      <div class="fine">
        <p><b>Closing note.</b>
          The admin lock restricts the client's dashboard only. It is not a takedown of the website, and a locked dashboard still shows the client its bookings, invoices and data and lets it export them. The provider never deletes the client's data unless the client asks, and an export is available at any time. Nothing in this licence authorises the provider to delete client data, stop the server or redirect a domain. Figures in the admin are read from the live ledger; where it cannot be read, the admin shows "record unavailable" with the last amount Stripe confirmed, and neither a lock, the lien sale state nor acceleration follows from an unreadable figure.
        </p>
